adox  the rumor mill has suggested that the  project could be set in the 70s in an  alternate timeline which sees cara  arrive to earth before her cousin  in order to set the film version of the  character apart from her tv incarnation  uzil has been at work on the script  since august 2018  so more details are sure to surface  sooner rather than later  what's the hurry  oh uh i'm with her check out one of our  newest videos right here  plus even more looper videos about your  favorite dc comics tv shows and movies  are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  [Music]  you
 

